<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Duke Realty lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Duke Realty lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said it downgraded Duke Realty Investments Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said &quot;while we continue to believe the company offers excellent investment potential, recent price appreciation has placed the total projected return within the buy-rating limits.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1/8 at 41-1/2.</p>
</text>
